{"id":"2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed","date":"2026-11-17","topic":"design","region":"americas","headline":"Famous Font Was Designed for a Cartoon Dog","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comic_Sans"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Vincent Connare worked at Microsoft in 1994.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.03,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.58,"times":[0.0,0.46,1.08,1.5,1.68,2.08,2.6]},{"text":"He saw a cartoon dog inside a computer program.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.16,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.24,"times":[0.0,0.02,0.2,0.46,0.88,1.38,1.88,2.12,2.48]},{"text":"The dog spoke with very serious printed letters.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.15,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":3.3,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.64,0.94,1.26,1.84,2.38]},{"text":"Vincent wanted friendly letters for the small dog character.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":5.23,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.66,1.1,1.64,1.94,2.04,2.32,2.56]},{"text":"He created a fun new letter style named Comic Sans.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.37,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.84,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.4,0.68,0.96,1.4,1.7,2.12,2.56,3.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":87,"core1800":5,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"worked","title":"Simple Past Tense","note":"The verb 'worked' shows an action completed in the past. It tells us what Vincent did back in 1994."},{"i":4,"focus":"named Comic Sans","title":"Past Participle as Modifier","note":"The phrase 'named Comic Sans' gives extra detail about the letter style. It functions like an adjective to specify the name of the new style."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1994, Vincent Connare worked as a font designer at Microsoft.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.64,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.2,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.8,2.16,2.86,3.26,3.58,3.7,3.94,4.32,4.78]},{"text":"He noticed a small dog character inside a new computer program.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.25,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.71,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.64,1.04,1.38,2.12,2.56,2.96,3.16,3.6]},{"text":"The dog used formal letters, so Vincent wanted a friendlier style.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.26,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":6.96,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.6,1.06,1.96,2.04,2.4,2.78,3.1,3.62]},{"text":"He copied the fun lettering of comic books to make Comic Sans.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.19,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.4,0.62,0.88,1.46,1.64,1.94,2.32,2.76,2.92,3.36]},{"text":"Microsoft will include the font in Windows, and millions will use it.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","V","O"],"dur":4.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":7.2,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.76,1.02,1.38,1.58,1.88,2.72,2.8,3.2,3.66,3.9]}],"bands":{"core1000":82,"core1800":6,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":10},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":", so","title":"Coordinating Conjunction","note":"The conjunction 'so' connects two independent clauses to show cause and effect. Because the dog used formal letters, Vincent decided to seek a friendlier style."},{"i":3,"focus":"to make Comic Sans","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"The phrase 'to make' uses a to-infinitive to state the reason behind an action. It answers why he copied comic book lettering."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1994, designer Vincent Connare evaluated a new software program for Microsoft.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.63,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":6.98,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.66,2.04,2.6,3.3,4.02,4.42,4.64,5.0,5.66,5.94]},{"text":"The program used a cartoon dog that spoke inside speech bubbles to assist users.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.28,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":6.42,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.38,0.68,0.98,1.32,1.82,2.34,2.62,2.94,3.5,3.9,4.28,4.46]},{"text":"A font is a set of letters that share a single visual design style.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","C","C","C","C","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.43,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":5.37,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.42,0.82,0.94,1.18,1.32,1.6,1.88,2.1,2.36,2.78,3.32,3.66]},{"text":"Connare felt that Times New Roman was too formal for a casual cartoon dog.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","S","V","C","C","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.0,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":5.56,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.54,0.76,1.08,1.4,1.68,2.06,2.38,2.9,3.24,3.36,3.76,4.32]},{"text":"He designed Comic Sans, which drew heavy inspiration from classic comic book lettering.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.86,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.46,0.9,1.98,2.02,2.22,2.52,3.04,3.58,3.86,4.34,4.72]},{"text":"Microsoft has included the famous font in its operating systems for many years.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.73,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.68,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.7,1.08,1.34,1.58,1.88,2.12,2.24,2.6,3.0,3.38,3.62]}],"bands":{"core1000":72,"core1800":7,"ngsl":7,"tsl":3,"nawl":1,"beyond":10},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"that Times New Roman was too formal for a casual cartoon dog","title":"Noun Clause as Object","note":"The subordinate clause beginning with 'that' serves as the direct object of 'felt'. It expresses the specific opinion Connare held."},{"i":4,"focus":"which drew heavy inspiration from classic comic book lettering","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"The relative clause starting with 'which' adds non-essential factual detail about Comic Sans. It is set off by a comma because the proper noun is already fully identified."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"While reviewing software in 1994, Microsoft designer Vincent Connare spotted an unusual design choice.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.86,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.56,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.74,1.36,1.74,3.34,3.58,4.42,4.72,5.38,5.96,6.24,6.62,7.16]},{"text":"A program called Microsoft Bob featured a cartoon dog that communicated through speech bubbles.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","S","V","M","M","M"],"dur":5.9,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.17,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.32,0.74,1.28,1.88,2.52,2.76,3.12,3.66,3.96,4.28,4.9,5.18]},{"text":"Connare noticed that the character spoke in Times New Roman, a formal typeface meant for traditional documents.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.5,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.93,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.58,0.96,1.04,1.3,1.76,2.0,2.3,2.7,3.52,3.68,4.04,4.66,5.0,5.22,5.56]},{"text":"A typeface, or font family, refers to the visual design of a complete set of letters.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":6.08,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.52,1.08,1.38,2.3,2.48,2.8,2.9,3.24,3.6,3.98,4.06,4.44,4.8,4.94]},{"text":"Believing that the font was far too formal for children, he decided to create a friendlier alternative.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.67,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":8.4,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.54,0.64,0.84,1.1,1.46,1.74,2.08,2.36,3.08,3.3,3.62,3.82,4.14,4.34,4.92]},{"text":"Drawing inspiration from comic books in his office, Connare created the informal lettering style named Comic Sans.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.69,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.35,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.52,1.16,1.36,1.76,1.94,2.02,2.86,3.06,3.54,3.7,4.0,4.76,5.06,5.46,5.88]},{"text":"Although the font missed the deadline for Microsoft Bob, programmers soon incorporated it into other products.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.71,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":8.04,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.32,0.48,0.82,1.1,1.4,1.7,1.9,2.82,3.18,3.64,4.24,4.5,4.74,5.0]},{"text":"It was included with Windows 95, becoming popular for casual use but heavily criticized when used in formal settings.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.39,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":9.22,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.14,0.5,0.72,0.9,2.16,2.42,2.9,3.16,3.52,3.86,4.4,4.84,5.3,5.72,5.92,6.12,6.34]}],"bands":{"core1000":76,"core1800":7,"ngsl":5,"tsl":4,"nawl":1,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":4,"focus":"Believing that the font was far too formal for children","title":"Present Participle Clause","note":"The present participle 'Believing' introduces an adjectival modifier explaining the subject's rationale. It describes the thoughts of 'he' prior to making his decision."},{"i":6,"focus":"Although the font missed the deadline for Microsoft Bob","title":"Concession Clause with Although","note":"The conjunction 'Although' introduces a concession clause. It shows contrast by stating a drawback that did not prevent the main clause action from occurring."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Back in 1994, Microsoft designer Vincent Connare set out to solve a surprisingly subtle visual design problem.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.51,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":11.89,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.58,2.18,2.58,3.32,3.66,4.38,4.86,5.04,5.18,5.42,5.64,6.22,6.98,7.46,7.84]},{"text":"While evaluating an entry-level program named Microsoft Bob, he noticed a cartoon dog issuing instructions inside speech bubbles.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.8,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":8.93,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.66,0.88,1.76,2.08,2.66,3.16,4.36,4.56,4.78,5.0,5.34,5.98,6.54,7.04,7.72,8.08]},{"text":"To his dismay, the friendly character spoke in Times New Roman, a traditional font typically reserved for newspapers and formal documents.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":11.04,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,1.34,1.5,1.78,2.22,2.68,2.92,3.22,3.62,4.3,4.7,5.02,5.34,5.82,6.26,6.62,6.92,7.58,7.88]},{"text":"Convinced that such rigid typography felt entirely out of place, Connare decided to craft a lighter, more approachable typeface.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":8.91,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.64,0.9,1.24,2.08,2.44,3.08,3.56,3.64,4.27,5.0,5.36,5.52,5.74,6.02,6.84,6.88,7.56]},{"text":"Typography refers to the art and technique of arranging letters and text to make them clear and visually appealing.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.4,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":7.89,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.8,1.18,1.28,1.56,1.76,2.16,2.4,2.66,3.26,3.58,3.88,4.4,4.5,4.66,5.06,5.36,5.7]},{"text":"Using only a mouse and cursor, he drew inspiration from hand-lettered comic books like Watchmen sitting in his office.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.74,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":7.67,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.7,0.82,1.14,1.42,2.24,2.36,2.58,2.96,3.26,4.1,4.38,4.74,5.04,5.62,5.86,6.08,6.18]},{"text":"Although the resulting font, Comic Sans, missed the release deadline for Microsoft Bob, developers quickly adopted it for other software.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":7.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":10.39,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.36,0.7,1.54,1.7,2.68,2.86,3.14,3.42,3.78,4.1,4.32,5.3,5.78,6.22,6.7,6.98,7.12,7.28]},{"text":"Microsoft subsequently bundled the typeface with Windows 95, catapulting it into global everyday use across schools and personal computers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/t5-7.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.48,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-17-design-famous-font-was-designed/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":9.57,"times":[0.0,0.46,1.06,1.48,1.8,2.22,2.4,2.58,3.78,4.5,4.58,4.78,5.14,5.74,6.26,6.62,7.08,7.32,7.58]},{"text":"Over the decades, Comic Sans gained huge popularity for informal contexts, yet faced widespread moc